      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly the problem is less that it \"feels\" wrong, and more that it takes away a utility that was there before. Many people are used to being able to see how many, and which of their friends are in an instance by glancing at the top of the \"here\" list, which is no longer possible. It's frustrating to have a design change take away a functionality that many previously relied on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
